{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Frequently Asked Questions"}], "prev": {"link": "../migrating-the-account-to-another-data-center/", "title": "Migrating the account to another data center"}, "next": {"link": "../peer-id-invalid-error/", "title": "PEER_ID_INVALID error"}, "title": "Why is the client reacting slowly in supergroups/channels?", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"why-is-the-client-reacting-slowly-in-supergroups-channels\">\n<h1>Why is the client reacting slowly in supergroups/channels?<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#why-is-the-client-reacting-slowly-in-supergroups-channels\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<p>Because of how Telegram works internally, every message you receive and send must pass through the creator\u2019s DC, and in\nthe worst case where you, the creator and another member all belong to three different DCs, the other member messages\nhave to go through from their DC to the creator\u2019s DC and finally to your DC. This is applied to each message and member\nof a supergroup/channel and the process will inevitably take its time.</p>\n<p>Another reason that makes responses come slowly is that messages are dispatched by priority. Depending on the kind\nof member, some users receive messages faster than others and for big and busy supergroups the delay might become\nnoticeable, especially if you are among the lower end of the priority list:</p>\n<ol class=\"arabic simple\">\n<li><p>Creator.</p></li>\n<li><p>Administrators.</p></li>\n<li><p>Bots.</p></li>\n<li><p>Mentioned users.</p></li>\n<li><p>Recent online users.</p></li>\n<li><p>Everyone else.</p></li>\n</ol>\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["faq/peer-id-invalid-error", "PEER_ID_INVALID error", "N", "next"], ["faq/migrating-the-account-to-another-data-center", "Migrating the account to another data center", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">Why is the client reacting slowly in supergroups/channels?</a></li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": false, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "faq/why-is-the-client-reacting-slowly-in-supergroups-channels", "sidebars": ["sidebar/brand.html", "sidebar/search.html", "sidebar/scroll-start.html", "sidebar/navigation.html", "sidebar/scroll-end.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0], "furo_version": "2025.12.19", "furo_navigation_tree": "", "furo_hide_toc": true, "furo_pygments": {"light": {"background": "#eeffcc", "foreground": "black"}, "dark": {"background": "#202020", "foreground": "#d0d0d0"}}}